                                "sense_id": "c89ac958-b30a-38d8-9370-38728ed30b93",
                                "text": "There are anywhere from ten to twelve chapters in the average porn, so that many blank pages can be inserted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "948c095e-5033-450d-87a9-87f7122f2854",
                                "sense_id": "c89ac958-b30a-38d8-9370-38728ed30b93",
                                "text": "— I’ve got it at home. Anyway, there was this gap between the final two porns."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec68e65-ebf0-4944-99d5-9bbc1b13b2a2",
                                "sense_id": "c89ac958-b30a-38d8-9370-38728ed30b93",
                                "text": "I remember once watching a porn with some friends of mine […]"
                            }
