                                "sense_id": "f18d77c2-e39c-3f22-a624-1e6df19e351e",
                                "text": "Because software is particularly good at counting, it can be used to create wonderfully compelling visualizations of quantitative data. These can be so compelling that they have even been called “info porn” (see the periodic table of visualizations)."
